  "project_section_mapping_library": {
    "version": "1.0",
    "purpose": "Map job posting buzzwords to deterministic resume project-name components ({{PROJECT_SCOPE}}, {{PROJECT_TYPE}}, {{PRIMARY_CAPABILITY}}, {{STRATEGIC_OUTCOME}}) and project bullet fragments for tailored resume generation. Employers are fixed (Mutual of Omaha, Metropolitan College, Metropolitan College); only descriptive wording is selected from these mappings.",
